### UC12 payment
POST http://localhost:8088/api/order/12001/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
X-Idempotency-Key: uc12-demo-pay
Content-Type: application/json

{"payMode":"THIRD_PARTY","payChannel":"WECHAT"}

### UC12 unpaid cancellation
POST http://localhost:8088/api/order/12002/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
X-Idempotency-Key: uc12-demo-cancel

### Persisted order state
GET http://localhost:8088/api/order/detail/12001
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
